  "description": "The fond left by seared steaks and the reduced beef stock gave this sauce an incredibly deep flavor to start, but pair that with heavy cream and brandy and the richness only multiples. The green peppercorns gave a great spice and texture but did little to hold back the shear heaviness of the sauce.",
